  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……灯織、緊張していないか？　大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──はい、大丈夫です\r\n今日まで、たくさん練習をしてきましたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ラッキーアイテムも身に着けていますし──\r\nそれに、集合時間の10分前には現場に着けていました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、問題ありません",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな──灯織はいつも時間に余裕を持って動けてる\r\n早めに現場に着くと、余裕ができるもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それだけじゃありません\r\n覚えてませんか？　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『10分前に次の現場に到着できたら仕事は成功する』\r\n『これで行こう！』",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうおっしゃったのはプロデューサーです\r\nこのジンクスを作ってくれたのはプロデューサーなんですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ──そうか、そんなこともあったか\r\n……ずっと覚えててくれたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "当然です\r\n普通に生活する上でも、10分前行動は大切ですから",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、きっと──……\r\nプロデューサーの言葉を頼ってる意味もありました",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……言ってませんでしたけど",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──ですから、今日のステージも必ず成功させてみせます\r\nファンのみなさんに、今までで一番の私を見てもらうんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……理想のライブには、届きそうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──それは、まだまだ……\r\nでも、今日できる精一杯と、練習の成果を──出し切ります",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうじゃないと、私を応援しに来てくれた方々を\r\n裏切ることになりますから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002002010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……今の私には、\r\n毎日積み重ねてきたと言えるものがあります──",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200201/1002002010150"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
